<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Lesson Overview</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01187</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Lesson Overview</md:title>
    <md:uuid>960a7e59-c480-4d52-9821-f18995fd1cb1</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you will learn how a function can be represented by two different equations. You will find any term of an arithmetic sequence directly, by using the <m:math display="inline"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mtext>th</m:mtext></m:msup></m:math> term formula to find any term number <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
<para id="para-00002">When you finish this lesson, you will be able to:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
  <item>Describe the <m:math display="inline"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mtext>th</m:mtext></m:msup></m:math> term.</item>
  <item>Find terms of sequences directly.</item>
  <item>Explain why different equations can represent the same sequence.</item>
</list>
<para id="para-00003">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that will help you reach those goals:</para>
<list id="list-00002">
  <item>
    4.18.1 Repeated Operations
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.2 Identifying Domain for a Function
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.3 Define an Arithmetic Sequence by the <m:math display="inline"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mtext>th</m:mtext></m:msup></m:math> Term
    <list id="list-00003">
      <item>
        4.18.3: Self Check
     </item>
      <item>
        4.18.3: Additional Resources
     </item>
    </list>
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.4 Define a Geometric Sequence by the <m:math display="inline"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mtext>th</m:mtext></m:msup></m:math> Term
    <list id="list-00004">
      <item>
        4.18.4: Self Check
     </item>
      <item>
        4.18.4: Additional Resources
     </item>
    </list>
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.5 Interchanging between Formulas
    <list id="list-00005">
      <item>
        4.18.5: Self Check
     </item>
      <item>
        4.18.5: Additional Resources
     </item>
    </list>
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.6 Different Types of Equations
 </item>
</list>
<para id="para-00004">After that, you'll <emphasis>practice and review</emphasis>.</para>
<list id="list-00006">
  <item>
    4.18.7 Practice
 </item>
  <item>
    4.18.8 Lesson Summary
 </item>
</list>
</section>
</content></document>
